                                "sense_id": "96850b39-2b95-30c1-a103-2bf17b2421cf",
                                "text": "(Not real coachy stuff to yell), but all I knew to yell. All of a sudden the other team got the puck away from my players and my friend's son, who was on his team, hit the puck with all his might Only In Debbie's World."
